{"id":"n1-015","title":"Noun + あっての + Noun","romaji":"A atte no B","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'B cannot exist without A'; 'B only exists because of A'.","longExplanation":"The 'Noun + あっての + Noun' pattern emphasizes that the second noun (B) exists only thanks to, or on the foundation of, the first noun (A). It's often translated as 'B is nothing without A' or 'B exists only because of A'.","formation":"Noun1 + あっての + Noun2","examples":[{"jp":"家族あっての私です。","romaji":"Kazoku atte no watashi desu.","en":"I am who I am thanks to my family.","words":[{"surface":"家族","vocabId":"1192150","reading":"かぞく"},{"surface":"あっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"お客様あってのビジネスです。","romaji":"Okyakusama atte no bijinesu desu.","en":"A business is nothing without its customers.","words":[{"surface":"お客様","vocabId":"1001770","reading":"おきゃくさま"},{"surface":"あっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ビジネス","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"練習あっての成功です。","romaji":"Renshuu atte no seikou desu.","en":"Success is nothing without practice.","words":[{"surface":"練習","vocabId":"1559160","reading":"れんしゅう"},{"surface":"あっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]},{"jp":"健康あっての仕事です。","romaji":"Kenkou atte no shigoto desu.","en":"Work is nothing without your health.","words":[{"surface":"健康","vocabId":"1256170","reading":"けんこう"},{"surface":"あっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":nul